=== 4. Unreadable API must not report healthy (pointed at a loopback port nothing listens on) ===
FATAL: could not read the OpenRouter balance after 1 attempt(s). Last error: /credits could not be reached: ECONNREFUSED

This is a failure to READ the balance, not a healthy balance. It is reported as a failure because a monitor that goes green when it could not reach the API asserts a state nothing verified.
